<p>
 <lb/>Nondum habui otium ad <rs type="lostletter">postremas gratiosissimas</rs> respondendi,
<lb/>Nunc etiam properanter scribo, quia <date>Crastina di<del>ei</del><add>e</add></date> iter adgredior
<lb/>in <rs type="place" key="place_VER-ungarn">Ungariam</rs> ad <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-128811110">Episcopum Agriensem</rs> pro instruenda <rs key="org_resource_000002" type="organisation">specula
<lb/>Astronomica</rs> hoc anno <choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> fundamentis <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-721239">Agri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> sumptuose, et
<lb/>splendide erecta, inde <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2761369">Viennam</rs> non nisi post hebdomadas
<lb/>quinque rediturus. Interea ut Desiderio Tuo satisfaciam
<lb/>mitto desideratos magnetes, et quidem ex singulis figuris
<lb/>unam, ut his pro arbitrio uti possis, opto ut effectum pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>stent, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stabunt autem hi si <choice><orig>1<hi rend="sup u">mo</hi></orig><reg>1<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></reg></choice> morbus sit nervorum, <choice><orig>2<hi rend="sup u">do</hi></orig><reg>2<hi rend="sup">do</hi></reg></choice>
<lb/>si magnes ei loco <add>corporis</add> applicetur, unde origo mali habetur.
</p>

